### 1. INBOX ROUTE AND PAGE COMPONENT

**File:** `/home/chapel/Projects/kynetic-spec-ui/packages/web-ui/src/routes/inbox/+page.svelte`

**Key Features:**
- Simple list view (not card-based like triage)
- Shows inbox items ordered by `created_at` descending (newest first)
- Add item functionality with modal input field
- Delete item functionality with confirmation dialog
- Item metadata: text, created_at, added_by, tags
- Empty state with helpful message
- Loading state with placeholder text
- Static mode read-only handling (hides Add/Delete buttons)
- AC-covered: @web-dashboard ac-16 through ac-19, @gh-pages-export ac-17, ac-18

**Loading Pattern:**
- Uses `onMount` to trigger initial load
- Reactive effect watches project version (for multi-project support)
- Manual state management with `$state` runes

**Delete Pattern:**
- Confirmation dialog before deletion
- Removal from list without reload (optimistic UI)

