### 6. DATA TYPES AND INTERFACES

**From @kynetic-ai/shared:**
- `InboxItem` interface (imported in api.ts line 19)
  - `_ulid: string` - Unique identifier
  - `text: string` - Item content
  - `created_at: string` - ISO timestamp
  - `added_by: string` - Author name
  - `tags: string[]` - Associated tags
  - All fields populated by daemon

- `TriageRecord` interface
  - `_ulid: string`
  - `inbox_ref: string` - Links to inbox item
  - `status: 'pending' | 'triaged' | 'acted_on'`
  - `action: TriageAction` (promote, delete, defer, spec-gap, duplicate)
  - `reasoning: string`
  - `decided_by: string`
  - `evidence_refs: string[]`
  - `override_reasoning?: string`
  - `override_by?: string`
  - `acted_at?: string`
  - `result_ref?: string`

- `PaginatedResponse<T>` wrapper
  - `items: T[]`
  - `total: number`
  - `offset?: number`
  - `limit?: number`

