### 13. STATIC SNAPSHOT SUPPORT

**Mode Store:** `/home/chapel/Projects/kynetic-spec-ui/packages/web-ui/src/lib/stores/mode.svelte.ts`

**Modes:**
- `loading` - Initial state
- `daemon` - Connected to live daemon
- `static` - Using read-only JSON snapshot

**Mode Detection:**
1. Check `VITE_STATIC_MODE` build flag
2. Try daemon health check (2s timeout)
3. Fall back to `kspec-snapshot.json` with `BASE_PATH` support
4. Default to daemon mode if both fail

**Static Data Functions:**
- `fetchInboxStatic(params)` - Returns snapshot inbox items
- `fetchTriageRecordsStatic(params)` - Returns snapshot triage data
- All have corresponding `__Static` versions for other entities

**Export Timestamp:**
- `getExportedAt()` - Returns snapshot export time for staleness indicator
- `getSnapshotProject()` - Returns project info from snapshot

---

### 14. MULTI-PROJECT SUPPORT

**Project Context:**
- Stored in `stores/project.svelte.ts`
- Selected project path passed via `X-Kspec-Dir` header
- Daemon routes use `projectContext.path` middleware
- WebSocket reconnects with project when changed

**Reload on Project Change:**
- All pages have reactive effect watching `getProjectVersion()`
- When version increments, data reloads via `loadInbox()` or equivalent
- Connection stored per-project path

